  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following oxidation reactions are carried out by both $\\mathrm{K}_2 \\mathrm{Cr}_2 \\mathrm{O}_7$ and $\\mathrm{KMnO}_4$ in acidic medium?\nA. $\\Gamma^{-} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{I}_2$\nB. $S^{2-} \\rightarrow S$\nC. $\\mathrm{Fe}^{2+} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Fe}^{3+}$\nD. $\\Gamma^{-} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{IO}_3{ }^{-}$\nE. $\\mathrm{S}_2 \\mathrm{O}_3{ }^{2-} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{SO}_4{ }^{2-}$\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "C, D and E Only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "B, C and D Only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A, D and E Only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A, B and C Only",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{I}^{-} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{OH}} \\mathrm{IO}_3^{-}$\n$\\mathrm{S}^{-2} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}^{+}} \\mathrm{S}$\n$\\mathrm{S}_2 \\mathrm{O}_3^{2-} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{OH}} \\mathrm{SO}_4^{2-}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{Fe}^{+2} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Fe}^{+3} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~S}_2 \\mathrm{O}_3^{2-} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{H}^{+}} \\mathrm{S} \\downarrow+\\mathrm{SO}_4^{2-}\n\\end{aligned}$"
